  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.distillation_tower.header": "Setting up a Distillation Tower",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.distillation_tower.text_1": "Apply a Distillation Controller to a Fluid tank to create a Distillation Tower.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.distillation_tower.text_2": "Pump in some Crude oil...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.distillation_tower.text_3": "... give the Blaze Burners some heat ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.distillation_tower.text_4": "... Gasoline and Diesel will be created",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.distillation_tower.text_5": "Distillation Towers can have windows.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.oil_chunk.header": "Finding an Oil Chunk",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.oil_chunk.text_1": "Certain Chunks have Crude Oil in them ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.oil_chunk.text_2": "... You can extract it using a Pumpjack",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.oil_chunk.text_3": "to find these Chunks, you will need to use an Oil Detector",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.oil_chunk.text_4": "Right-click the Oil Detector and it will output the amount of Crude Oil in the current Chunk",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.oil_chunk.text_5": "Additionally, different Biomes will have different levels of Crude Oil",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.header": "Setting up a Pumpjack",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_1": "To create a Pumpjack, find an Oil Chunk and place a Pumpjack Bearing",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_2": "Next, build the body of the Pumpjack using the blocks you want",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_3": "Attach a Pumpjack Head ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_4": "... and another Pumpjack Bearing",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_5": "Don't forget to glue the contraption!",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_6": "To power the Pumpjack, you need to use a Pumpjack Crank.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_7": "To extract Crude Oil from the chunk, will need to excavate a hole below the pumpjack head ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_8": "... and place a straight, vertical pipe going all the way to bedrock ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_9": "... finally, attach a Pumpjack Hole",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_10": "Once you assemble the contraption ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.pumpjack.text_11": "... you can extract the crude oil with a Mechanical Pump.",

  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.diesel_engine.header": "Setting up a Diesel Engine",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.diesel_engine.text_1": "Diesel Generators are a compact way of generating kinetic energy.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.diesel_engine.text_2": "Give it some fuel and it will produce kinetic energy.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.basin_fermenting_station.header": "Setting up a Basin Processing Station",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.basin_fermenting_station.text_1": "Basin Lids allow you to process fluids and items into other fluids and items.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.basin_fermenting_station.text_2": "Once you give it the required ingredients ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.basin_fermenting_station.text_3": "... The Basin Processing Station will start processing them.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.large_diesel_engine.header": "Setting up a Modular Diesel Engine",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.large_diesel_engine.text_1": "Modular Diesel Generators function like normal Diesel generators.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.large_diesel_engine.text_2": "Once you give them some fuel, they will produce Kinetic Energy ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.large_diesel_engine.text_3": "... They can be stacked.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.large_diesel_engine.text_4": "They will generate stress proportionally to how much engines you stack.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.engine_silencer.header": "Setting up an Engine Silencer",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.engine_silencer.text_1": "Engine Silencers are used to make Diesel Engines Silent.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.engine_silencer.text_2": "Once you apply an Engine Silencer, the Diesel Engine will stop making any noises.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.huge_diesel_engine.header": "Setting up a Huge Diesel Engine",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.huge_diesel_engine.text_1": "Huge Diesel Engines connect to Shafts ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.huge_diesel_engine.text_2": "... they will start generating Kinetic Energy, once you give them some fuel.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.burner.header": "Setting up a Burner",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.burner.text_1": "Burners can provide Heat to items processed in a Basin",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.burner.text_2": "The burner needs to be fed a flammable liquid",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.burner.text_3": "The burners burn rate can be controlled with a valve",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.chemical_turret.header": "Setting up a chemical turret",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.chemical_turret.text_1": "Chemical turrets are standalone versions of chemical sprayers.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.chemical_turret.text_2": "They need to be supplied with a fluid, and powered by a cogwheel.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.chemical_turret.text_3": "When powered with redstone, the turret will start spraying with the fluid in its tank.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.chemical_turret.text_4": "Additionally they can be upgraded with a lighter.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.automatic_turret.header": "Automatically controlling turrets",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.automatic_turret.text_1": "Turrets can also be controlled by mobs.",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.automatic_turret.text_2": "Simply add an entity filter, into the filter slot of the turret ...",
  "createdieselgenerators.ponder.automatic_turret.text_3": "... the turret operator will shoot any mobs, that match the filter.",

